Na9O_gyOOCkkjt_AL9H4r5q5xWGHL6ZRyPHGqM2IJs2w&oe=6AD390C4"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "467916352871409", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003282_467916356204742_1871921057092171900_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kMxUxsilTDcQ7kNvwFPFfpM&_nc_oc=AdoWbuqHCnHQX6_6CfEJwcY9GSYgDaRD1VKOg4BwZLUcFrFhiEnM6jVfZ0w1zwzgIEU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPj6Ae9Wx6Z7m_hw1_5feUHJNd87AKMmlNU5MiSiQqjww&oe=6AD3ADA2"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1934382610375855", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974473_1934382613709188_7156337812617042679_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3B4IWAK8k2oQ7kNvwFBDk4H&_nc_oc=AdrmCi1p--M73aDNhyctZPup3mO0dzr9PCjk4JPu3tbjTSvBNIuZbklyrIAsf3eDYm4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPzICiE1sLYVHLLN1hBM1-a1QLFL-7Nps5fb_aTRP9L-A&oe=6AD397B3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "1524760081483769", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974531_1524760084817102_6497712644828891067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5BnXZsJxVQEQ7kNvwG8MX7P&_nc_oc=Adr1LcLu8Akpq3M03qoCIVLcR2UJa_bF3M71GVHvX84QFCSW_Sq02pWytpKbQeaJa3k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMXcIMm1uj49I-FHHw4MvRKDN8u-MC320JP81-bPKf0tw&oe=6AD396AF"}, "display_name": "Mystery Box VR: Hidden Secrets", "keywords": [], "long_description": " AN IMMERSIVE VR PUZZLE EXPERIENCE\nInteract with objects, handles, buttons, and wheels on each side. Crack enigmas and collect hidden puzzle tiles on a random side of the boxes.\n\nYou won't be able to compare reality with fiction.\n\n# DISCOVER INVENTIONS\nOnce you unlock all 8 boxes of a Level Pack, you can compose a puzzle and discover a brief history of an invention.\n\nIt's not always easy to escape the room, so use all your IQ to crack the riddles. There's a logic behind all of them, even where it seems it's not!\n\n# IMMERSIVE SOUNDTRACK\nPlay the game with your headphones to get immersed in this amazing adventure.\n\n# HINTS\nGot stuck on some enigma? No worries, you can still get a helpful hint! You can also get in touch with me in case you really can't make it through a riddle, I'll be glad to help ;)\n\n# MULTILANGUAGE\nAvailable in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, and Japanese.\n\nThe game language will change automatically based on the language settings of your device", "short_description": "A VR escape room game where you have to solve intriguing riddles to open boxes and discover nice stories about popular inventions!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "$R36BSY5.png", "id": "3678762505771822", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031430_3678762509105155_2151975047074617165_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=25cVwVCv7DcQ7kNvwE7LUMN&_nc_oc=Adpa6Qa7IKcaA1ZmsYgpe2uqXkWV6YQS1jubtCKrxS1M9GUyj5DyqK6bpAKLyt7-oI0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNsvPyFnVSeCvAuNtoGOdJTM61FKFMcov4wSa4lDrdEhw&oe=6AD392A5"}, {"file_name": "$R81V725.png", "id": "2720695481426567", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262743_2720695484759900_604086922326600035_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_yBDZjoD0xYQ7kNvwFbWqqQ&_nc_oc=AdrkBmpjAaORlJcrj6TRIli79QeVAqt_5s1fJXgVwEO0RIl7v95IZgxYJ91PcknHrBc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPyrwFD_Zs2ex20IYTjMZwvoz1qophSeSDCDN2wEK5dfQ&oe=6AD3918D"}, {"file_name": "$RQ3SN6U.png", "id": "1552311425628973", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982519_1552311428962306_1218130395049083834_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gD06BwcY1e8Q7kNvwEJr0Xh&_nc_oc=AdofGJD_wkneZN_a2ktN6VpuLWOGkhuw6ohLaJbWmqn3whh74cqL1lfTOx6U6Z4qQwQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=